{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "01",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Лекция: Работа с данными. Расчёт коэффициента корреляции\n",
    "\n",
    "**Дисциплина:** Введение в анализ больших данных  \n",
    "**Задание 5** (адаптация с языка R на Python)\n",
    "\n",
    "Темы задания:\n",
    "- Генерация выборок (нормальное, биномиальное)\n",
    "- Описательные статистики\n",
    "- Эмпирическая функция распределения (ECDF)\n",
    "- Корреляция Пирсона, Спирмена, Кендалла + проверка значимости\n",
    "- Стандартизация\n",
    "- Логарифмирование\n",
    "- Датасет `mtcars`: точечные диаграммы, группировка, ECDF/гистограммы\n",
    "\n",
    "Основные библиотеки: **NumPy**, **SciPy**, **Pandas**, **Matplotlib**, **Seaborn**.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "02",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0. Импорт библиотек\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "03",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from scipy import stats\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (10, 6)\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.size'] = 11\n",
    "sns.set_style(\"whitegrid\")\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Библиотеки загружены\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "04",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 1. Нормальная выборка x1\n",
    "\n",
    "В R: `rnorm(n=100, mean=3, sd=2)`\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "05",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x1 = stats.norm.rvs(loc=3, scale=2, size=100)\n",
    "# или: x1 = np.random.normal(3, 2, 100)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"x1 (первые 10 значений):\", x1[:10].round(3))\n",
    "print(f\"\\nСреднее (mean)      : {x1.mean():.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Ст. отклонение (sd) : {x1.std(ddof=1):.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Дисперсия (var)     : {x1.var(ddof=1):.4f}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "06",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 2. Биномиальная выборка x2\n",
    "\n",
    "В R: `rbinom(n=500, size=10, prob=0.5)`  \n",
    "(параметры в задании: 500, 10, 0.5)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "07",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x2 = stats.binom.rvs(n=10, p=0.5, size=500)\n",
    "# или: x2 = np.random.binomial(10, 0.5, 500)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"x2 (первые 20 значений):\", x2[:20])\n",
    "print(\"\\nОписательные статистики (summary):\")\n",
    "print(pd.Series(x2).describe())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "08",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 3. Эмпирическая функция распределения (ECDF)\n",
    "\n",
    "В R: `ecdf(x)`\n",
    "\n",
    "В Python:\n",
    "- `statsmodels.distributions.empirical_distribution.ECDF`\n",
    "- или вручную через сортировку + `np.arange`\n",
    "- или `sns.ecdfplot`\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "09",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from statsmodels.distributions.empirical_distribution import ECDF\n",
    "\n",
    "ecdf1 = ECDF(x1)\n",
    "ecdf2 = ECDF(x2)\n",
    "\n",
    "# График ECDF и гистограмм\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# ECDF\n",
    "axes[0].step(ecdf1.x, ecdf1.y, where=\"post\", label=\"x1 (нормальное)\", color=\"blue\")\n",
    "axes[0].step(ecdf2.x, ecdf2.y, where=\"post\", label=\"x2 (биномиальное)\", color=\"orange\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Эмпирические функции распределения (ECDF)\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Значение\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel(\"F(x)\")\n",
    "axes[0].legend()\n",
    "axes[0].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Гистограммы\n",
    "axes[1].hist(x1, bins=15, density=True, alpha=0.6, label=\"x1\", color=\"blue\")\n",
    "axes[1].hist(x2, bins=range(0, 12), density=True, alpha=0.6, label=\"x2\", color=\"orange\", align=\"left\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Гистограммы\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Значение\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylabel(\"Плотность\")\n",
    "axes[1].legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "10",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 4. Вектор x2_100 (последние 100 значений x2)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "11",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x2_100 = x2[-100:]\n",
    "print(\"Длина x2_100:\", len(x2_100))\n",
    "print(\"Первые 10:\", x2_100[:10])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "12",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 5. Коэффициенты корреляции и проверка значимости\n",
    "\n",
    "В R: `cor(x, y, method=...)`, `cor.test(x, y, method=...)`\n",
    "\n",
    "| Метод | Когда использовать |\n",
    "|-------|--------------------|\n",
    "| **Пирсон** | Линейная связь, обе переменные ≈ нормальные |\n",
    "| **Спирмен** | Монотонная связь, ранги / порядковые шкалы |\n",
    "| **Кендалл** | Порядковые шкалы, мало связанных рангов |\n",
    "\n",
    "Интерпретация \|r\|:\n",
    "- 0 – 0.1 — практически нет связи\n",
    "- 0.1 – 0.5 — слабая\n",
    "- 0.5 – 0.7 — умеренная\n",
    "- 0.7 – 1.0 — сильная\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "13",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Коэффициенты корреляции\n",
    "r_pearson, p_pearson = stats.pearsonr(x1, x2_100)\n",
    "r_spearman, p_spearman = stats.spearmanr(x1, x2_100)\n",
    "r_kendall, p_kendall = stats.kendalltau(x1, x2_100)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=== Коэффициенты корреляции ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"Пирсон   : r = {r_pearson:.4f}, p-value = {p_pearson:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Спирмен  : r = {r_spearman:.4f}, p-value = {p_spearman:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Кендалл  : r = {r_kendall:.4f}, p-value = {p_kendall:.4f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nИнтерпретация:\")\n",
    "if p_pearson < 0.05:\n",
    "    print(\"Пирсон: связь статистически значима (отвергаем H0 об отсутствии связи)\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Пирсон: связь НЕ значима (нет оснований отвергать H0)\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "14",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### График зависимости x1 и x2_100\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "15",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 6))\n",
    "plt.scatter(x1, x2_100, alpha=0.7, edgecolors=\"black\", s=50)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"x1 (нормальное)\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"x2_100 (биномиальное)\")\n",
    "plt.title(f\"Зависимость x1 и x2_100\\nПирсон r = {r_pearson:.3f}\")\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "16",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 6. Матрица x3 и корреляционная матрица x4\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "17",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# x3: объединение x1 и x2_100\n",
    "x3 = np.column_stack([x1, x2_100])\n",
    "print(\"Матрица x3 (форма):\", x3.shape)\n",
    "print(x3[:5])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "18",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# x4: разбить x2 на 5 частей (как 5 столбцов)\n",
    "# 500 элементов → 5 столбцов по 100\n",
    "x4 = x2.reshape(100, 5)   # или reshape(5, 100).T\n",
    "print(\"Матрица x4 (форма):\", x4.shape)\n",
    "print(\"Первые 5 строк:\\n\", x4[:5])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Матрица корреляций\n",
    "corr_x4 = np.corrcoef(x4, rowvar=False)  # столбцы как переменные\n",
    "print(\"\\nМатрица корреляций x4:\")\n",
    "print(np.round(corr_x4, 3))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "19",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Красивая визуализация корреляционной матрицы\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(7, 6))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(corr_x4, annot=True, fmt=\".2f\", cmap=\"coolwarm\",\n",
    "            xticklabels=[f\"col{i+1}\" for i in range(5)],\n",
    "            yticklabels=[f\"col{i+1}\" for i in range(5)],\n",
    "            vmin=-1, vmax=1, center=0)\n",
    "plt.title(\"Матрица корреляций x4\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "20",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 7. Стандартизация\n",
    "\n",
    "В R: `scale(x)`  \n",
    "Вручную: `(x - mean(x)) / sd(x)`\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "21",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Автоматическая стандартизация\n",
    "x2_scaled = (x2 - x2.mean()) / x2.std(ddof=1)\n",
    "# или: from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n",
    "\n",
    "# Вручную (то же самое)\n",
    "x2_st = (x2 - np.mean(x2)) / np.std(x2, ddof=1)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Первые 5 (scale):\", x2_scaled[:5].round(4))\n",
    "print(\"Первые 5 (вручную):\", x2_st[:5].round(4))\n",
    "print(\"Совпадают?\", np.allclose(x2_scaled, x2_st))\n",
    "print(f\"\\nПосле стандартизации: mean ≈ {x2_st.mean():.6f}, sd ≈ {x2_st.std(ddof=1):.6f}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "22",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 8. Логарифмирование x1\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "23",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# log(x1) с округлением до 3 знаков\n",
    "# Важно: x1 может содержать отрицательные → log не определён\n",
    "# Берём только положительные или используем log1p / abs\n",
    "\n",
    "x1_positive = x1[x1 > 0]\n",
    "x1_log = np.round(np.log(x1_positive), 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"log(x1) (первые 10):\", x1_log[:10])\n",
    "print(f\"n после фильтрации: {len(x1_log)}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "24",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 9. Датасет mtcars\n",
    "\n",
    "В R: `data(mtcars)`, `dotchart(mpg, ...)`\n",
    "\n",
    "В Python mtcars доступен, например, через seaborn или напрямую.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "25",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Загрузка mtcars\n",
    "url = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vincentarelbundock/Rdatasets/master/csv/datasets/mtcars.csv\"\n",
    "mtcars = pd.read_csv(url, index_col=0)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(mtcars.head())\n",
    "print(\"\\nСтолбцы:\", mtcars.columns.tolist())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "26",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Точечная диаграмма (dotchart) по mpg\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "27",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Сортируем для наглядности\n",
    "mtcars_sorted = mtcars.sort_values(\"mpg\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 8))\n",
    "colors = mtcars_sorted[\"cyl\"].map({4: \"green\", 6: \"blue\", 8: \"red\"})\n",
    "plt.scatter(mtcars_sorted[\"mpg\"], range(len(mtcars_sorted)),\n",
    "            c=colors, s=80, edgecolors=\"black\", zorder=3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.yticks(range(len(mtcars_sorted)), mtcars_sorted.index, fontsize=8)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Миль на галлон (mpg)\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Экономичность двигателя (dotchart)\\nЦвет = число цилиндров\")\n",
    "plt.grid(True, axis=\"x\", alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Легенда\n",
    "from matplotlib.lines import Line2D\n",
    "legend_elements = [\n",
    "    Line2D([0], [0], marker='o', color='w', markerfacecolor='green', markersize=10, label='4 cyl'),\n",
    "    Line2D([0], [0], marker='o', color='w', markerfacecolor='blue', markersize=10, label='6 cyl'),\n",
    "    Line2D([0], [0], marker='o', color='w', markerfacecolor='red', markersize=10, label='8 cyl'),\n",
    "]\n",
    "plt.legend(handles=legend_elements, title=\"Цилиндры\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "28",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Описательные статистики mpg по vs\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "29",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"=== mpg (вся выборка) ===\")\n",
    "print(mtcars[\"mpg\"].describe())\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== mpg по vs (0 = V-образный, 1 = рядный) ===\")\n",
    "print(mtcars.groupby(\"vs\")[\"mpg\"].describe())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "30",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### ECDF и гистограммы mpg (вся выборка и по vs)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "31",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(12, 10))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Гистограмма всей выборки\n",
    "axes[0, 0].hist(mtcars[\"mpg\"], bins=12, color=\"steelblue\", edgecolor=\"black\", alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[0, 0].set_title(\"Гистограмма mpg (вся выборка)\")\n",
    "axes[0, 0].set_xlabel(\"mpg\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ECDF всей выборки\n",
    "ecdf_mpg = ECDF(mtcars[\"mpg\"])\n",
    "axes[0, 1].step(ecdf_mpg.x, ecdf_mpg.y, where=\"post\", color=\"steelblue\")\n",
    "axes[0, 1].set_title(\"ECDF mpg (вся выборка)\")\n",
    "axes[0, 1].set_xlabel(\"mpg\")\n",
    "axes[0, 1].set_ylabel(\"F(x)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Гистограммы по vs\n",
    "for v, color in zip([0, 1], [\"coral\", \"seagreen\"]):\n",
    "    subset = mtcars.loc[mtcars[\"vs\"] == v, \"mpg\"]\n",
    "    axes[1, 0].hist(subset, bins=8, alpha=0.6, label=f\"vs={v}\", color=color, edgecolor=\"black\")\n",
    "axes[1, 0].set_title(\"Гистограмма mpg по vs\")\n",
    "axes[1, 0].set_xlabel(\"mpg\")\n",
    "axes[1, 0].legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "# ECDF по vs\n",
    "for v, color in zip([0, 1], [\"coral\", \"seagreen\"]):\n",
    "    subset = mtcars.loc[mtcars[\"vs\"] == v, \"mpg\"]\n",
    "    ecdf_v = ECDF(subset)\n",
    "    axes[1, 1].step(ecdf_v.x, ecdf_v.y, where=\"post\", label=f\"vs={v}\", color=color)\n",
    "axes[1, 1].set_title(\"ECDF mpg по vs\")\n",
    "axes[1, 1].set_xlabel(\"mpg\")\n",
    "axes[1, 1].legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "32",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Логарифм mpg и повтор графиков\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "33",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "mtcars[\"log_mpg\"] = np.log(mtcars[\"mpg\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].hist(mtcars[\"log_mpg\"], bins=12, color=\"purple\", edgecolor=\"black\", alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Гистограмма log(mpg)\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"log(mpg)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "ecdf_log = ECDF(mtcars[\"log_mpg\"])\n",
    "axes[1].step(ecdf_log.x, ecdf_log.y, where=\"post\", color=\"purple\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"ECDF log(mpg)\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"log(mpg)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Сравнение: логарифмирование часто делает распределение более симметричным.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "34",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Шпаргалка: R → Python\n",
    "\n",
    "| Задача в R | Python |\n",
    "|------------|--------|\n",
    "| `rnorm(n, mean, sd)` | `stats.norm.rvs(loc, scale, size)` |\n",
    "| `rbinom(n, size, prob)` | `stats.binom.rvs(n=size, p=prob, size=n)` |\n",
    "| `mean / sd / var` | `.mean()` / `.std(ddof=1)` / `.var(ddof=1)` |\n",
    "| `summary(x)` | `pd.Series(x).describe()` |\n",
